<view class="page">
  <view class="h1">家里有什么</view>
  <view class="muted">油、盐、生抽按常备，不用勾。勾过的食材才会用来配早、中、晚。也可在下方直接说话，多轮会记住忌口与问答。</view>
  <view class="grid">
    <view wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{item.on ? 'on' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle">
      <image class="food" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
      <text>{{item.name}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <input class="input" placeholder="例如：我不吃海带，帮推荐" value="{{chatText}}" bindinput="onChatInput" />
  <view class="save" bindtap="match">按这些食材推荐三道（真实接口）</view>
  <view class="muted" style="margin-top:12rpx" bindtap="goAskMeal">去问餐页看节点分析 ›</view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{memoryAnswer}}">记忆回答：{{memoryAnswer}}</view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{matchNote}}">{{matchNote}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{matches}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <text class="grow">{{item.name}}</text>
      <text class="ink nowrap">规则分 {{item.score}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="muted" wx:if="{{item.energy != null}}">这一份 {{item.energy}} 千卡</view>
    <view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view>
    <view class="step">{{item.step}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted" wx:if="{{dishSlots.length}}">菜状态：
    <text wx:for="{{dishSlots}}" wx:key="dish">{{item.dish.name}}({{item.status}}) </text>
  </view>
  <view class="save" bindtap="make">配出今天、一周和这个月</view>
</view>
